\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come sinners, to the gospel feast,
\par Let every soul be Jesu's guest;
\par Ye need not one be left behind,
\par For God hath bidden all mankind.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Sent by my Lord, on you I call;
\par The invitation is to all:
\par Come, all the world; come, sinner, thou!
\par All things in Christ are ready now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Come, all ye souls by sin oppressed,
\par Ye restless wanderers after rest,
\par Ye poor, and maimed, and halt, and blind,
\par In Christ a hearty welcome find.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. His love is mighty to compel;
\par His conquering love consent to feel,
\par Yield to His love's resistless power,
\par And fight against your God no more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. This is the time; no more delay!
\par This is the Lord's accepted day;
\par Come in, this moment, at His call,
\par And live for Him who died for all.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

